 "globalIdField": "",
 "description": "Voting precincts for the Commonwealth of Massachusetts. Established based on the 2020 Decennial Census by each municipality and approved by the Local Election Districts Review Commission (LEDRC) in accordance with state law.These data reflect the statewide change in population for the Commonwealth of Massachusetts based on the 2020 Decennial Census and the new precinct and ward lines established by each municipality and reviewed and approved by the Local Election Districts Review Commission (LEDRC) in accordance with the procedures set forth in state law. The dataset represents those precincts and wards approved by the LEDRC being passed to the State Legislature for Redistricting.",
